WEBVTT

00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:15.375
You alright, love?

00:00:15.417 --> 00:00:17.792
Would you mind helping
a frail old woman?

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.583
I've missed my bus.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:24.542
- Come on in. Come on out of the cold.
- Oh, thank you. You're so kind.

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:36.625
It's locked from the other side.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.167
Leave it to me.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:41.083
What use is my old chemistry set?

00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:43.708
- Potassium nitrate, sulphur.
- Hmm?

00:00:43.792 --> 00:00:45.292
This stuff is lethal, Dad.

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:50.583
Would you like a wee nip of antifreeze
for the old pacemaker?

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.792
No, no, no. Not while I'm on duty.

00:00:54.708 --> 00:00:57.958
Oh. Too strong for you, huh?

00:00:58.917 --> 00:01:03.292
Oh. Fighting talk. OK. I'll have one.

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:07.125
Three, two, one.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.208
- Jonathan! That's 50,000 volts of...
- I know what I'm doing!

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.583
Go for it!

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:36.958
Go!

00:01:40.542 --> 00:01:43.208
No, best of three. I wasn't ready.
Come on.

00:02:06.583 --> 00:02:08.167
It's locked.

00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:10.667
- What do we do now?
- I know.

00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:16.667
- Henry! Henry, do not go out there!
- Do it, Dad.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:18.708
Someone has to.

00:02:20.417 --> 00:02:22.500
And that someone is me.

00:02:22.583 --> 00:02:24.250
Oh, I say!

00:02:35.292 --> 00:02:37.000
My hero.

00:02:43.542 --> 00:02:44.792
Crikey.

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:52.708
Oh!

00:02:52.792 --> 00:02:54.125
Whoa!

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.125
Actually, this is insane.

00:02:57.958 --> 00:03:01.125
- Dad is properly cool.
- He certainly is.

00:03:10.583 --> 00:03:14.042
I give up. I've gotta get back to work.

00:03:14.667 --> 00:03:17.125
Look, wait, wait, wait.

00:03:18.167 --> 00:03:21.125
Where's your fighting spirit?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:40.750
Henry!

00:03:43.083 --> 00:03:45.125
Dad!

00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:51.875
Thank you.

00:03:51.917 --> 00:03:53.250
He's alright.

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.083
Good dog. Mwah!

00:04:02.083 --> 00:04:03.500
Paddington!

00:04:03.875 --> 00:04:05.000
Paddington!

00:04:05.042 --> 00:04:07.042
Up here!

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.708
Is that you, God?

00:04:10.792 --> 00:04:12.042
What?

00:04:12.125 --> 00:04:15.042
It's just you sound a lot more
like Mr Brown than I imagined.

00:04:15.167 --> 00:04:16.958
It is Mr Brown.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.708
Mr Brown!
What are you doing out there?

00:04:19.792 --> 00:04:21.375
We've come to rescue you!

00:04:21.458 --> 00:04:22.792
You have?

00:04:22.875 --> 00:04:27.042
Mr Curry explained everything.
I'm so sorry I didn't believe you.

00:04:31.542 --> 00:04:33.417
Sabotage.

00:04:37.792 --> 00:04:39.875
Paddington, get out of there!

00:04:53.042 --> 00:04:53.958
Bear!

00:05:16.042 --> 00:05:17.667
Give up, bear!

00:05:19.458 --> 00:05:20.542
Give up, bear!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.833
There's no way out.

00:06:03.083 --> 00:06:04.542
Henry!

00:06:05.292 --> 00:06:07.208
- Where's Paddington?
- I don't know.

00:06:07.292 --> 00:06:10.042
Shh. I can hear something.

00:06:10.083 --> 00:06:14.417
- That's just the pipes.
- That's not pipes. That's bear.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.167
- He's going for the roof.
- Come on!

00:06:33.583 --> 00:06:34.750
Upstairs.

